given-names></name><name><surname>Jensen</surname><given-names>NPB</given-names></name><name><surname>Blom</surname><given-names>JY</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Viral aetiology of enzootic pneumonia in Dainish dairy herds: diagnostic tools and epidemiology</article-title><source>Vet Rec</source><year>1996</year><volume>139</volume><fpage>114</fpage><lpage>117</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8856889</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B31"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Virtala</surname><given-names>A-MK</given-names></name><name><surname>Mechor</surname><given-names>GD</given-names></name><name><surname>Gr&#x000f6;hn</surname><given-names>YT</given-names></name><name><surname>Erb</surname><given-names>HN</given-names></name><name><surname>Dubovi</surname><given-names>EJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Epidemiologic and pathologic characteristics of respiratory tract disease in dairy heifers during the first three months of life</article-title><source>J Am Vet Med Assoc</source><year>1996</year><volume>208</volume><fpage>2035</fpage><lpage>2042</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8707680</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B32"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Virtala</surname><given-names>A-MK</given-names></name><name><surname>Gr&#x000f6;hn</surname><given-names>YT</given-names></name><name><surname>Mechor</surname><given-names>GD</given-names></name><name><surname>Erb</surname><given-names>HN</given-names></name><name><surname>Dubovi</surname><given-names>EJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Association of seroconversion with isolation of agents in transtracheal wash fluids collected From pneumonic calves less than three months of age</article-title><source>The Bov Pract</source><year>2000</year><volume>34</volume><fpage>77</fpage><lpage>80</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B33"><citation citation-typ